---
import Layout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LayoutSection from "../../components/ui/LayoutSection.astro";
import Section from "../../components/ui/Section.astro";
import HeroBanner from "../../components/ui/HeroBanner.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import Heading from "../../components/ui/Heading.astro";
import BookDemo from "../../components/ui/BookDemo.astro";
import Blockquote from "../../components/ui/Blockquote.astro";
import FlippingCard from "../../components/ui/FlippingCard.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout>
  <LayoutSection containerSize="full" padding="p-0">
    <div class="text-center text-shadow-md text-shadow-neutral-950">
      <HeroBanner
        height="sm"
        image="../../assets/images/asset-criticality-banner-01.jpg"
      >
       <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl  lg:text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white">
          Blended PM Optimization
        </h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed text-white">
          Increase uptime, reduce PM Cost – 30% faster!
        </p>
      </HeroBanner>
    </div>
  </LayoutSection>

  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 pt-8 md:grid-cols-1 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 divide-y divide-accent/80">
        <div class="pb-6 border-b border-neutral-300">
          <Eyebrow class="text-black">
            TAKE THE EMOTION OUT OF YOUR DECISIONS
          </Eyebrow>

          <Heading class="mb-4" level={4}>
            <span class="">Forget Spreadsheet-Based PM Optimization</span>
          </Heading>
          <p class="mb-6">
            After years of facilitating <strong>PM Optimization</strong>,
            exercises on spreadsheets, we had a major epiphany! We developed a
            better way; a total solution that solves the most common problems
            with traditional <strong>FMEA </strong> and <strong
              >RCM programs</strong
            >
            in 30% of the time.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>Blended PM Optimization</strong>
            goes beyond simply optimizing the preventive maintenance plans into developing
            an entire strategy for maintaining your assets. Include your digital strategy,
            develop TPM/ODR Operations reliability, PdM Condition Monitoring, maintenance
            inspections, lubrication, and replacement activities (where needed).
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto text-xl leading-8 italic">
          “Not only were we able to accomplish what would have taken us weeks in
          a matter of days, the tangible results blew the doors off of our FMEA
          approach”
          <span class="block text-right mt-2 italic"
            >~ Director of Global Engineering</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </LayoutSection>
  <LayoutSection
    containerSize="7xl"
    variant="surface"
    shape="right-top-bottom-clipped"
    padding="py-30"
  >
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 pt-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <Heading level={5} class="mb-4">
            <span>Problems We Solve…</span>
          </Heading>
          <ul
            class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
          >
            <li>The old process took WAY too long.</li>
            <li>Was dependent on “experts” and intimidating.</li>
            <li>No analytics on the impact of work performed.</li>
            <li>Independent spreadsheets were not scalable.</li>
            <li>
              Management of the program was manual outside of the exercise.
            </li>
            <li>
              Getting the work back into the CMMS was cumbersome & time
              consuming.
            </li>
            <li>
              No way to leverage our CMMS data, work order history or existing
              job plans.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="my-6">
          <Heading level={5} class="mb-4">
            <span>Solution Details…</span>
          </Heading>
          <p>
            The process, management, toolkit and training provides a full
            end-to-end system that delivers massive results in a practical
            model. Each aspect of the BPMO System ensures success for the
            corporate team, local site or individual exercise.
          </p>

          <ul
            class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
          >
            <li>Analytics-driven PM program baselining</li>
            <li>CoE-Corporate program design</li>
            <li>Strategic asset selection system</li>
            <li>PMO exercise management</li>
            <li>Self-guided PMO process</li>
            <li>Full scale impact analytics</li>
            <li>Exercise leverage library</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <Blockquote
          class="max-w-7xl mx-auto border-none shadow-none"
          variant="quote"
          textColor="text-accent"
        >
          This is the fastest, most accurate and practical PM Optimization
          System available.
        </Blockquote>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Heading level={5} class="mb-4">
            <span>What we offer…</span>
          </Heading>
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-6 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip col-span-2"
              minHeight="16rem"
              frontTitle="Full immersion Pilot Project"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Experience the total optimization process in a hand-on remote or on-site optimization of your assets."
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip col-span-2"
              minHeight="16rem"
              frontTitle="Training & Coaching"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Remote, on-site and on-demand eLearning training programs to make you an expert in no time."
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip col-span-2"
              minHeight="16rem"
              frontTitle="360Navigator SaaS Optimization Suite"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Self-guided and automated application to optimize or develop your total asset strategy."
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip col-span-3"
              minHeight="12rem"
              frontTitle="Corporate CoE Program Solution"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Full-scale program design, training, exercise management and analytics across the entire organization"
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip col-span-3"
              minHeight="12rem"
              frontTitle="Turn-Key Optimization Services"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Supplement your capacity with our reliability team’s expertise and bandwidth for the fastest results"
            />
          </div>

          <Heading
            level={5}
            class="my-6 font-normal! leading-normal text-right italic text-neutral-500"
          >
            <span
              >Blended PM Optimization offers solutions to streamline your
              processes and meet your challenges.</span
            >
          </Heading>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </LayoutSection>
  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl">
    <article class="my-6">
      <Heading class="mb-4" level={5}>
        <span>Following a unique, practical, and automated process…</span>
      </Heading>

      <p>
        This self-guided, standardized <strong>Blended PM Optimization </strong> System
        will make you an optimization expert in no time. You will revolutionize your
        overall asset reliability strategy, elevate uptime, and drive down the annual
        cost-to-maintain in a fraction of the time of traditional methods.
      </p>

      <Heading class="mb-4" level={5}>
        <span> Exercise Effectiveness and Process Efficiency </span>
      </Heading>

      <p>
        In a side-by-side comparison between traditional FMEA/RCM and our BPMO
        approach, 30-50% time savings can be achieved using the Asset Analytix
        Blended PM Optimization approach.
      </p>

      <HeroBanner
        class="mt-6 min-h-125!"
        height="lg"
        image="../../assets/images/BPMO-Comparison-chevrons-02.png"
      />
    </article>
  </LayoutSection>
  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-1 gap-2">
      <div class="mt-8">
        <Heading level={5} class="mb-4">
          <span class="block text-accent">Wondering about these issues?</span>
        </Heading>

        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700">
          <li>How can we convey value to site leadership?</li>
          <li>We want to own the process and not be tied to a consultant</li>
          <li>We don’t have time to do this.</li>
          <li>We already have a PMO program.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="my-6">
          <BookDemo
            class="mx-auto"
            backgroundImage="../../assets/images/bgn-quotes.jpg"
            buttonLabel="Book a Demo Today"
            href="/book-demo"
            minHeight="5rem"
            demoHeading="There is so much more to this amazing process and technology! Click to request a demo and learn more."
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </LayoutSection>
</Layout>
